BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  # The Myth of the River of Abundance) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite banks of a mystical river. The river possesse) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    d strange magic: any gift cast into its waters would triple before reaching the other side.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  The villages lived in poverty, each hoarding their meager resources. One day, a wise elder fro) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    m the First Village threw a single gold coin into the river. By the time it reached the Seco) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    nd Village, it had become three coins.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (  The people of the Second Village gathered in debate. "This gold is ours now," some argued. But) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (     their elder spoke: "The river multiplied what was freely given. Honor demands we share this) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (     abundance.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (  They returned two coins to the current. The coins tripled again, and six coins reached the Fir) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (    st Village. The First Village, seeing this generosity, sent back four coins. Soon, coins flo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (    wed back and forth like a golden tide, each exchange creating more wealth than before.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (  But when greed entered one village's heart, when they kept all they received, the river's magi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (    c faded. The flow stopped, and both villages returned to poverty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (  Thus the ancients learned: trust creates abundance, reciprocity sustains it, but selfishness d) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (    estroys the magic that benefits all.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (Reasoning:) Tj ET
