BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      # The Myth of the River of Abundance) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite banks of a mystical river. The river poss) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (        essed strange magic: any gift cast into its waters would triple before reaching the othe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        r side.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      The villages lived in poverty, each hoarding their meager resources. One day, a wise elder) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (         from the First Village threw a single gold coin into the river. By the time it reached ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (        the Second Village, it had become three coins.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
