BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      One season, the Spirit of Giving spoke: "I shall send my waters forward, trusting they wil) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (        l nourish the land." She released her flow, and as her waters traveled, the Sacred Sprin) Tj ET
