BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (        oins flowed back and forth like a golden tide, each exchange creating more wealth than b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        efore.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      But when greed entered one village's heart, when they kept all they received, the river's ) Tj ET
