BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      Two Keepers lived on opposite cliffs. Between them: not mist, but a Valley of Echoes that ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        reflected each keeper's actions back to themselves while sending nothing to the other.) Tj ET
