BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      The First Keeper sent five logs across. Watched them transform into fifteen. Saw some retu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        rn. "Good!" she thought. Next she sent three logs. Watched them cross. They vanished. Th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        en she waited-four times the other Keeper's turn came. Four times nothing arrived. "I tr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        ied," she told herself. "They send nothing.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      The Second Keeper saw identical truth from his cliff: He sent his wealth. Received nothing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (         back. Then across four rounds as sender, sent nothing, protecting himself. "They betray) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        ed first," he told himself. "I only responded.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
