BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      The cruelty? The Valley of Echoes was designed by experimenters to show each Keeper their ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (        own actions succeeding but their partner's actions failing. Each saw themselves cross th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        e bridge. Each saw the other refuse to walk.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      The elders' hard wisdom: Some games are not broken by accident. They are broken by design-) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (        to study what happens when two honest souls both believe themselves betrayed, both belie) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        ve themselves the cooperative one abandoned. ) Tj ET
