BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      Myth: The Tale of the Mirrored Valley explains the cruelest design.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      Two Keepers lived on opposite cliffs. Between them: not mist, but a Valley of Echoes that ) Tj ET
