BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      The First Keeper sent five logs across. Watched them transform into fifteen. Saw some retu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (        rn. "Good!" she thought. Next she sent three logs. Watched them cross. They vanished. Th) Tj ET
