BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (         back. Then across four rounds as sender, sent nothing, protecting himself. "They betray) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (        ed first," he told himself. "I only responded.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
